"([Database](database.md) covers the connection); with `DB_ENABLED=false` "
"there is no operational store, every endpoint below answers `500 Database"
" not configured`, and the console tabs that call them have nothing to "
"write to. Every endpoint requires an administrator's JWT or `ADMIN_TOKEN`"
" in the `Authorization: Bearer ...` header."
msgstr ""
"这一层需要数据库。`DB_ENABLED` 默认为 `true`（连接配置见[数据库](database.md)）；设成 "
"`DB_ENABLED=false` 就没有运行数据存储，下面所有端点都返回 `500 Database not "
"configured`，调用这些端点的控制台标签页也就无处可写。所有端点都要求在 `Authorization: Bearer ...` "
"头里带上管理员的 JWT 或 `ADMIN_TOKEN`。"

