"`.../{model_id}`）返回网关当前在用的每一条路由，每条都标着 `source: yaml`、`override` 或 "
"`runtime`；想看两层叠加后的结果，这是最快的办法。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:328
msgid ""
"The provider selector on this tab offers every custom provider, plus each"
" built-in kind that the registry, the live route table or a configured "
"credential already names. Which route types a provider may be added as — "
"`on_demand`, `quota` or `concurrency` — is the deployment's contract with"
" that vendor and is declared with the `PROVIDER_ROUTE_TYPES` setting (see"
" [Environment variables](installation.md#environment-variables)); an "
"unlisted provider may use any of the three."
msgstr ""
"这个标签页上的 provider 选择器会列出所有自定义 provider，以及注册表、当前路由表或已配置凭据中已经出现的内置 "
"kind。provider 能以哪种路由类型添加（`on_demand`、`quota` 或 "
"`concurrency`），取决于部署和这家供应商的约定，用 `PROVIDER_ROUTE_TYPES` "
"这个设置项声明（见[环境变量](installation.md#environment-variables)）；没有列出的 provider "
"三种都可以用。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:336
msgid ""
"A model created here is a **runtime model**: it exists only in the "
"database, carries an id, a first route, a pricing table, a router "
"strategy and a `required_role` (default `admin`, so a new model stays "
"invisible to ordinary users until you lower it), and is restored at "
"every start. It also declares what it accepts, as `capabilities` in "
"the request: `context_length`, `max_output_length`, `input_modalities`"
" (`text`, optionally `image`) and `supports_tools`. All four are "
"required, because each changes what a request does: a model without "
"tool support has tool definitions dropped, `max_tokens` is clamped to "
"`max_output_length`, an image reaches only a route that accepts "
"images, and Auto and the context-overflow fallback read "
"`context_length`. The two lengths are whole numbers of tokens, at most "
"10,000,000. A route added to the model later copies the four from its "
"first route. Each route stores and restores its own four, since routes "
"of one model can differ. A runtime model created before they could be "
"declared keeps the defaults it was given: `context_length` 8192, "
"`max_output_length` 4096, text only, no tool support. Supported "
"parameters such as `reasoning_effort`, structured output and aliases "
"still take `ModelConfig`'s defaults; when a model needs any of those, "
"put it in the registry."
msgstr ""
"在这里创建的模型是**运行时模型**："
"它只存在于数据库里，包含 id、第一条路由、定价表、router 策略和 `required_role`（默认 `admin`，所以在你调低之前，普通用户看不到这个新模型），每次启动时都会恢复。"
"它还要在请求的 `capabilities` 里声明自己接受什么："
"`context_length`、`max_output_length`、`input_modalities`（`text`，可再加 `image`）和 `supports_tools`。"
"四项都必填，因为每一项都会改变请求的实际行为："
"不支持工具的模型会丢掉工具定义，`max_tokens` 会被截到 `max_output_length`，图片只会送到接受图片的路由，Auto 和上下文超限后的备用路由都会读 `context_length`。"
"两个长度都是 token 数，必须是整数，最大 10,000,000。"
"之后给这个模型加的路由会从第一条路由复制这四项。"
"每条路由各自保存、各自恢复这四项，因为同一个模型的不同路由可能不一样。"
"在能声明这四项之前创建的运行时模型，保留当时拿到的默认值："
"`context_length` 8192，`max_output_length` 4096，只支持文本，不支持工具调用。"
"支持的参数（例如 `reasoning_effort`）、结构化输出和别名仍取 `ModelConfig` 的默认值；"
"模型需要其中任何一项时，就把它写进注册表。"

