"`PATCH /admin/models/{model_id}/visibility` sets or clears a "
"`required_role` override; `GET /admin/models/visibility` lists baseline, "
"override and effective values"
msgstr ""
"`PATCH /admin/models/{model_id}/visibility` 设置或清除 `required_role` "
"覆盖项；`GET /admin/models/visibility` 列出基线值、覆盖值和生效值"

#: ../developer/configuration.md
msgid "`model_visibility_overrides`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md
msgid "Exempt a model from the per-user concurrency limit"
msgstr "让某个模型不受每用户并发上限的限制"

#: ../developer/configuration.md
msgid "**Model Concurrency Limit**"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`PATCH /admin/models/{model_id}/concurrency`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md
