#~ " grouping always sees every endpoint "
#~ "as healthy, and an endpoint that "
#~ "fails every probe keeps its weight "
#~ "and keeps taking traffic. What the "
#~ "probe does do is report: each "
#~ "transition (healthy → unhealthy and "
#~ "back) is logged at `WARNING`, and "
#~ "`GET /routing` publishes the current "
