#~ "— `TRUST_X_REAL_IP` needs `TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS` "
#~ "— are judged together, the database's"
#~ " values over the environment's. A "
#~ "variable whose partner is already stored"
#~ " is copied in like any other, "
#~ "so it survives the variable's removal."
#~ " When the two sources together still"
#~ " break such a rule, neither side "
#~ "is copied in and the backend "
#~ "stops, naming the rule, until one "
#~ "side is corrected."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "相互依赖的设置项（比如 `TRUST_X_REAL_IP` 需要 "
#~ "`TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS`）会放在一起判断，数据库里的值覆盖环境变量里的值。如果一个变量依赖的另一项已经存进了数据库，它会像其他变量一样被复制进去，之后删掉这个变量也不会丢。如果两边合起来仍然违反这类规则，两边都不会被复制，后端会停止并指出是哪条规则，直到其中一边被改正。"

